<p data-start=3D"474" data-end=3D"617">This workflow is <strong data-start=
=3D"491" data-end=3D"536">reversible, scalable, and production-safe</strong=
>, and it=E2=80=99s exactly what your earlier obfuscator design was trying =
to implement.</p>
<p data-start=3D"619" data-end=3D"860">It=E2=80=99s also worth noting that =
in practice, most companies <strong data-start=3D"675" data-end=3D"752">don=
